/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the five stages of the Demographic Transition Model, detailing birth rate, death rate, population growth, and the Demographic Dividend.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Demographic Transition Model: Five Seral Stages and the Demographic Dividend:) Tj
T*
(   1. Foundational Concept \(Warren Thompson and Frank Notestein\):) Tj
T*
(   The Demographic Transition Model \(DTM\) conceptualizes the historical progression of national) Tj
T*
(   birth and death rates as agrarian pre-industrial societies modernize into advanced) Tj
T*
(   urban-industrial economies:) Tj
T*
(   2. The Five Sequential DTM Stages:) Tj
T*
