(   in stone crushing, granite mining, foundry work, sandblasting, and ceramic manufacture.) Tj
T*
(   - Macrophage Phagocytosis and Lysosomal Rupture:) Tj
T*
(   * Alveolar macrophages engulf crystalline silica particles via scavenger receptors.) Tj
T*
(   * The highly reactive, cleaved silanol \(-Si-OH\) surface groups on quartz crystals generate) Tj
T*
(   massive hydroxyl and superoxide free radicals, peroxidizing membrane lipids.) Tj
T*
(   * Phagolysosomes destabilize and rupture, spilling acidic hydrolases and silica crystals) Tj
T*
(   directly into the macrophage cytosol.) Tj
T*
(   - NLRP3 Inflammasome Activation:) Tj
T*
(   * Cytosolic silica activates the NLRP3 inflammasome multiprotein complex, which cleaves) Tj
T*
(   pro-caspase-1 into active caspase-1.) Tj
T*
(   * Caspase-1 enzymatically converts pro-interleukin-1-beta into active Interleukin-1-beta) Tj
T*
(   \(IL-1-beta\), releasing high concentrations of IL-1-beta and Tumor Necrosis Factor-alpha) Tj
T*
(   \(TNF-alpha\).) Tj
T*
(   * The macrophage undergoes lytic cell death \(pyroptosis\), releasing the undigested silica) Tj
T*
(   particle back into the alveolar space to be engulfed by fresh macrophages, establishing a) Tj
T*
(   permanent, self-sustaining inflammatory cascade!) Tj
T*
(   - Fibrogenesis and Silicotic Nodules:) Tj
T*
(   * Persistent cytokine signaling recruits interstitial fibroblasts, which proliferate and) Tj
T*
(   deposit concentric whorls of dense, hyalinized type I collagen around central quartz cores) Tj
T*
(   \(Silicotic Nodules\).) Tj
T*
(   * Silicotic nodules coalesce into Massive Progressive Fibrosis, destroying alveolar gas) Tj
T*
(   exchange, causing irreversible restrictive respiratory failure and elevating tuberculosis risk) Tj
T*
(   30-fold.) Tj
T*
(   3. Pathogenesis of Asbestosis and Mesothelioma:) Tj
T*
(   - Asbestos consists of fibrous silicate minerals: Serpentines \(curly chrysotile / white) Tj
T*
(   asbestos\) and Amphiboles \(needle-like rigid crocidolite / blue asbestos and amosite\).) Tj
T*
(   - Frustrated Phagocytosis: Amphibole fibers possess high aspect ratios \(length:width > 3:1\) and) Tj
T*
(   lengths exceeding 10 to 20 micrometers. Alveolar macrophages cannot fully engulf these long) Tj
T*
(   needles \('frustrated phagocytosis'\), leaking chronic proteolytic enzymes, generating persistent) Tj
T*
(   pleural inflammation, pulmonary fibrosis, and inducing malignant DNA double-strand breaks that) Tj
T*
(   lead to fatal Pleural Mesothelioma.) Tj
T*
