(   [Problem Statement]: Examine the Narmada Bachao Andolan \(NBA, 1985\), focusing on big dam controversies, Sardar Sarovar submergence, and tribal human rights.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Narmada Bachao Andolan: Big Dam Geopolitics, Ecological Submergence, and Tribal Human) Tj
T*
(   Rights:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Narmada Valley Development Project:) Tj
T*
(   The Narmada River is the fifth longest river in India. The Narmada Valley Development Project) Tj
T*
(   was conceived as the largest river valley engineering project in the world, encompassing 30) Tj
T*
(   major dams, 135 medium dams, and over 3,000 minor dams, anchored by the gigantic multi-purpose) Tj
T*
(   Sardar Sarovar Dam \(Gujarat\) and Narmada Sagar Dam \(Madhya Pradesh\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Genesis of Narmada Bachao Andolan \(NBA, 1985\):) Tj
T*
(   - Founded by social activist Medha Patkar, joined by veteran Gandhian Baba Amte.) Tj
T*
(   - The Social and Ecological Crisis:) Tj
T*
(   * Submergence of over 37,000 hectares of fertile alluvial farmland and dense deciduous teak) Tj
T*
(   forests.) Tj
T*
(   * Complete physical and cultural displacement of over 250,000 project-affected persons \(PAPs\),) Tj
T*
(   predominantly indigenous Adivasi tribal communities \(Bhil, Bhilala, Tadvi\) who lacked formal) Tj
T*
(   written land titles.) Tj
T*
(   * Severe lack of genuine Rehabilitation and Resettlement \(R&R\): Displaced tribal families were) Tj
T*
(   offered inadequate cash compensation or relocated to barren, stony resettlement sites devoid of) Tj
T*
(   water, firewood, or grazing commons, fracturing ancient community survival structures.) Tj
T*
