(   3. The World Bank Independent Morse Commission \(1992\):) Tj
T*
(   - NBA organized massive non-violent marches, hunger strikes, and Jal Satyagraha \(protesters) Tj
T*
(   refusing to leave their ancestral huts as floodwaters rose, standing up to their necks in) Tj
T*
(   rising dam waters\).) Tj
T*
(   - International Pressure forced the World Bank to appoint an independent evaluation mission) Tj
T*
(   headed by Bradford Morse.) Tj
T*
(   - The Morse Report \(1992\) issued a scathing condemnation of the Sardar Sarovar Project,) Tj
