T*
(   readily substitutes for Ca2+ in biological systems, but binds with higher affinity, disrupting) Tj
T*
(   calcium signaling:) Tj
T*
(   - Crosses the blood-brain barrier by masquerading as Ca2+ in calcium-ATPase channels.) Tj
T*
(   - In presynaptic nerve terminals, Pb2+ inappropriately activates Protein Kinase C \(PKC\) and) Tj
