(   Established as a planned program by the Ministry of Environment, Forest and Climate Change) Tj
T*
(   \(MoEFCC\), Government of India, following recommendations of the Tiwari Committee \(1980\). ENVIS) Tj
T*
(   serves as a nationwide decentralized network for comprehensive collection, storage, retrieval,) Tj
T*
(   and electronic dissemination of environmental information to scientists, engineers,) Tj
T*
(   policymakers, and the public.) Tj
T*
(   2. The Decentralized Distributed Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   ENVIS operates through a decentralized hub-and-spoke organizational architecture coordinated by) Tj
T*
(   the ENVIS Focal Point located within the MoEFCC in New Delhi:) Tj
T*
(   - 1. ENVIS Hubs \(State Government Nodes\):) Tj
T*
(   * Established within State Departments of Environment or State Pollution Control Boards across) Tj
T*
(   all Indian states and Union Territories.) Tj
T*
(   * Mandate: Collecting and hosting statewide environmental databases, state-of-environment) Tj
T*
(   reports \(SoER\), status of river catchments, and local municipal solid waste management data.) Tj
T*
(   - 2. ENVIS Resource Partners \(Thematic Nodes\):) Tj
T*
(   * Established within premier specialized national research institutions, university) Tj
T*
(   departments, and environmental centers of excellence:) Tj
T*
(   * Examples: Wildlife Institute of India \(Faunal Biodiversity\); Botanical Survey of India) Tj
T*
(   \(Floral Diversity\); NEERI \(Environmental Engineering & Water Quality\); TERI \(Renewable Energy\);) Tj
T*
(   IIT Bombay \(Environmental Biotechnology\); Forest Research Institute \(Forestry Management\).) Tj
T*
(   * Mandate: Building specialized national databases on their specific thematic discipline,) Tj
T*
(   publishing bibliographic monographs, and responding to technical user queries.) Tj
T*
(   3. Modern Upgrades: Environmental Information, Awareness, Capacity Building and Livelihood) Tj
T*
(   Programme \(EIACP\):) Tj
T*
(   - Aligned with the national Digital India initiative and Mission LiFE \(Lifestyle for) Tj
T*
(   Environment\).) Tj
T*
(   - Functions as an open-access web portal integrating geospatial maps, real-time National Air) Tj
T*
(   Quality Index \(NAQI\) feeds, coastal zone databases, and green technology patents.) Tj
T*
(   - Administers the Green Skill Development Programme \(GSDP\), training rural and urban youth in) Tj
T*
(   solar panel maintenance, river water quality testing, sewage plant operation, and forest) Tj
T*
(   monitoring.) Tj
